{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You have been kidnapped, and your fate will be decided behind the wall you must destroy. Here is your remote control.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is how the story of the hero begins in the new game from the studio <strong>Shader Mess</strong>. It\u2019s a variation on the well-known Breakout or Arkanoid, enriched with RPG elements, a story, quests with unique rewards, and perhaps even a few original tricks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697370/extras/ae4e194e86946bd0786b93526a4fb552.poster.avif?t=1758265540\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697370/extras/ae4e194e86946bd0786b93526a4fb552.webm?t=1758265540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697370/extras/ae4e194e86946bd0786b93526a4fb552.mp4?t=1758265540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can look forward to plenty of explosions, crumbling bricks, powered-up balls, tricky enemies, and other action-packed elements. The demo version of the game, which will soon be available for download, will offer the first 10 levels and a taste of everything the full game will expand into a complete gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697370/extras/860462e8f3e41aeb52dbdb229a78abd4.avif?t=1758265540\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To make <strong>Beyond The Space Wall</strong> accessible to the widest possible audience, the game is fully playable with a keyboard, a keyboard/mouse combo, or a controller. The option to rebind all control keys is, of course, included.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697370/extras/369da92c18bb3eeb3f35aa695a32ee2b.avif?t=1758265540\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the game isn\u2019t just about breaking bricks and smashing walls. Some quests will require you to complete specific missions \u2013 defeating a unique enemy, retrieving a treasure from hard-to-reach bricks, finding a secret level, and so on. Which path will your story take?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Total Annihilation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3697370/5b496ca8629c464d97545f8be98f33a8e4fb13fe.jpg"},{"name":"Air Defense","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3697370/e090a1d1120ac61d0c9dc947e98928190e60acea.jpg"},{"name":"Lightning Reflexes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3697370/ef85dd2a482a12e347609c53e72c9f3a2f4a6f4a.jpg"},{"name":"Who Needs Bonuses?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3697370/e256f558cf04e6ac9ba6e2fb591f0764c02b758b.jpg"},{"name":"Rocket Man","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3697370/8198191ba765df740a666f7250f29dec68ba7c39.jpg"},{"name":"Juggling Apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3697370/6d9895542effcde72549dd155ec37cef761f0b34.jpg"},{"name":"Juggling Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3697370/ac41a2b02e95a41bc36e3c8d8cac1c8df37ea6b1.jpg"},{"name":"Juggling Grandmaster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/image