ing a secret level, and so on. Which path will your story take?</p>","developers":["Shader Mess"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697370/586edc02164a99bb5f7fa874816bcd5277ce0fff/header.jpg?t=1758265540","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3697370/1249150191/52786d9356f4a509c8a77c62bad743124132a819/1754125443/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754128932","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3697370/1249150191/52786d9356f4a509c8a77c62bad743124132a819/1754125443/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754128932","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3697370/1249150191/52786d9356f4a509c8a77c62bad743124132a819/1754125443/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754128932","id":257177148,"name":"Beyond The Space Wall trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257177148/c2ca2cd615fffa8fe811563e21c706511157cb63/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754128932"}],"name":"Beyond The Space Wall","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Beyond The Space Wall - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$12.99</span> $1.94 USD","packageid":1301964,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":"-85% ","price_in_cents_with_discount":194}],"title":"Buy Beyond The Space Wall"}],"packages":[